## Course Introduction

**Agentic Software Engineering** explores how artificial intelligence agents are integrated across the software development lifecycle—from requirements and design to coding, testing, deployment, and maintenance.

The course focuses on three core areas:
- **Human-AI Collaboration:** Building autonomous workflows and applying prompt engineering to boost productivity.
- **Quality Assurance:** Evaluating AI-generated outputs against professional engineering standards.
- **Responsible AI:** Applying ethical practices, safety, and human oversight in AI-assisted systems.

This repository documents my hands-on activities, case studies, and reflections throughout the course.
